      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Standing definitely sets it off. It happens on and off. Uh, I've had a widespread sunburn-like rash too, for about a week. A sudden high fever was there, but it's gone away on its own.",
